# Keep the build context (and anything COPY'd wholesale, like apps/dashboard) free of local
# state: a host node_modules/.next would overwrite the image's own platform-specific install, and
# .env files / the local SQLite database (which holds hashed API keys) must never be baked in.
.git
.venv
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
neuroforge.db
neuroforge_state
reproduce_output
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
